#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Infrastructure > Storage` is for adding and managing Storage Buckets, File "
"Shares, Volumes, Data Stores and Storage Servers for use with other Services"
" in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"`Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` es para adding y managing Almacenamiento "
"Buckets, Archivo Shares, Volumes, Datos Stores y Almacenamiento Servidores "
"para usar con otro Servicios en |morpheus|."

