msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:16
msgid ""
"There are two Role permissions for the `Infrastructure > Storage` section: "
"`Infrastructure: Storage` and `Infrastructure: Storage Browser`. "
"`Infrastructure: Storage` give Full, Read or No access to the "
"`Infrastructure > Storage` sections, while `Infrastructure: Storage Browser`"
" is specific to `Buckets` and `Files Shares`. Full `Infrastructure: Storage "
"Browser` permissions allows `Buckets` and `Files Shares` to be browsed and "
"files and folders to be added, downloaded and deleted from the `Buckets` and"
" `Files Shares`. Read `Infrastructure: Storage Browser` permissions allows "
"`Buckets` and `Files Shares` to be browsed only."
msgstr ""
"Hay son two Rol permisos para el `Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` sección:"
" `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento` y `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento "
"Browser`. `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento` dar Completo, Read o No acceso "
"al `Infraestructura > Almacenamiento` sections, mientras `Infraestructura: "
"Almacenamiento Browser` es específico a `Buckets` y `Files Shares`. Completo"
" `Infraestructura: Almacenamiento Browser` permisos permite `Buckets` y "
"`Files Shares` a be browsed y archivos y folders a be agregado, downloaded y"
" eliminado desde el `Buckets` y `Files Shares`. Read `Infraestructura: "
"Almacenamiento Browser` permisos permite `Buckets` y `Files Shares` a be "
"browsed solo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:19
msgid "Default Storage"
msgstr "Predeterminado Storage"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage.rst:21
msgid ""
"The default Storage path for Virtual Images, Backups, Deployment Archives, "
"Archive Service, and Archived Snapshots is `var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/`. "
"Its is recommended to add Storage Buckets and File Shares for these targets "
"in the `Infrastructure > Storage` section to avoid running out of disk space"
" on the |morpheus| Appliance."
msgstr ""
"El predeterminado Almacenamiento ruta para Virtual Imágenes, Backups, "
"Despliegue Archives, Archive Servicio, y Archived Snapshots es "
"`var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/`. Su es recomendado a agregar Almacenamiento "
"Buckets y Archivo Shares para estos targets en el `Infraestructura > "
"Almacenamiento` sección a avoid ejecutando out de disco space en el "
"|morpheus| Appliance."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/buckets.rst:2
msgid "Storage Buckets"
msgstr "Storage Buckets"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/buckets.rst:4
msgid ""
"Storage Buckets are for Backup, Archives, Deployment and Virtual Images "
"storage targets. Buckets can be browsed and files and folders can be "
"uploaded, downloaded or deleted from the Bucket section. Retention Policies "
"can be set on Storage Buckets for files to be deleted or backed up to "
"another bucket after a set amount of time."
msgstr ""
"Almacenamiento Buckets son para Backup, Archives, Despliegue y Virtual "
"Imágenes storage targets. Buckets puede be browsed y archivos y folders "
"puede be uploaded, downloaded o eliminado desde el Bucket sección. Retention"
" Policies se puede establecer en Almacenamiento Buckets para archivos a be "
"eliminado o backed hasta another bucket después de un establecer amount de "
"tiempo."

