#: ../../infrastructure/storage/file_shares.rst:336
msgid ""
"Upon save |morpheus| will create a persistent mount owned by ``morpheus-"
"app.morpheus-app`` on the |morpheus| Appliance for the NFSv3 File Share. The"
" |morpheus| appliance will require access to the following ports in order to"
" mount the share: 111, 54302, 20048, 2049, 46666, 42955, 875. With some "
"storage solutions, you may need to enable insecure, unprivileged ports, or "
"allow non-root on the export before |morpheus| is able to successfully mount"
" the share."
msgstr ""
"Upon guardar |morpheus| será crear un persistente mount owned por "
"``morpheus-app.morpheus-app`` en el |morpheus| Appliance para el NFSv3 "
"Archivo Share. El |morpheus| appliance será requerir acceso al siguiente "
"puertos para mount el share: 111, 54302, 20048, 2049, 46666, 42955, 875. Con"
" algunos storage solutions, you puede necesita a habilitar insecure, "
"unprivileged puertos, o permitir non-root en el export antes de |morpheus| "
"es able a exitosamente mount el share."

