#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:2
msgid "Share Access Control"
msgstr "Share Access Control"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:7
msgid ""
"Share Access controls allow administrators to manage host-level access rules"
" for File Shares associated with storage servers. Access rules define which "
"hosts or IP addresses can connect to a file share and what level of access "
"they are granted (e.g., read-only, read/write)."
msgstr ""
"Share Acceso controls permitir administrators a manage host-nivel acceso "
"reglas para Archivo Shares asociado con storage servidores. Acceso reglas "
"define cual hosts o IP direcciones puede connect a un archivo share y qué "
"nivel de acceso they son granted (e.g., read-solo, read/write)."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:9
msgid ""
"Share Access rules are specific to File Shares that are backed by a Storage "
"Server integration (such as Dell EMC Isilon or other NAS platforms). The "
"available access rule options are determined by the storage server type."
msgstr ""
"Share Acceso reglas son específico a Archivo Shares ese son backed por un "
"Almacenamiento Servidor integration (como Dell EMC Isilon o otro NAS "
"platforms). El disponible acceso regla opciones son determined por el "
"storage servidor tipo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:14
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` role permission at **Full** level is required to"
" create, edit, or delete access rules."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` permiso de rol en **Full** nivel es requerido a "
"crear, editar, o eliminar acceso reglas."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/share_access.rst:15
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` role permission at **Read** level allows viewing"
" access rules only."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Storage`` permiso de rol en **Read** nivel permite viewing"
" acceso reglas solo."

