#: ../../infrastructure/storage/storage_hosts.rst:7
msgid ""
"Storage Hosts represent the physical or virtual hosts that are connected to "
"a Storage Server for the purposes of volume presentation and LUN mapping. "
"When a storage server is integrated into |morpheus| (for example, HPE 3PAR),"
" the platform automatically syncs and caches the registered hosts and host "
"sets from the storage array."
